  MergingAggregated
    GatherExchange
      JoinLogical (Broadcast HashJoin )
        Aggregating
          Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
            ReadFromMergeTree (ParallelRead default.t_push_facts)
        Expression (Change column names to column identifiers)
          ReadFromMergeTree (ReplicatedRead default.t_push_dims)
